msgid "Segurium"
msgstr "Segurium"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: segurium.php
msgid "https://segurium.com"
msgstr "https://segurium.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: segurium.php
msgid ""
"Lean, AI-powered WordPress security: malware scanning, brute-force "
"protection, 2FA, geo-blocking, integrity checks — without the bloat."
msgstr ""
"Slanke, AI-gestuurde WordPress-beveiliging: malware-scanning, brute-force-"
"bescherming, 2FA, geo-blokkering, integriteitscontroles — zonder ballast."

#. Description of the plugin
#: segurium.php
msgid ""
"Site hacked? Free WordPress malware removal: scan, clean infected files, "
"restore them. Plus firewall, brute-force protection, 2FA, geo-blocking."
msgstr ""
"Site gehackt? Gratis WordPress malwareverwijdering: scannen, geïnfecteerde "
"bestanden opschonen en terugzetten. Plus firewall, brute-force bescherming, "
"2FA en geo-blokkering."

